lated to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you use the Future tense in the interrogative form, you can use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">will</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "To create a <span class=\"italic\">yes</span> or <span class=\"italic\">no</span> question, use:<br>  Will (or Won't) + subject + base form of the verb.<br><span class=\"italic\">Will you come look at apartments with me?</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Wh- questions are questions that require more information in their answers. Typical wh- words are what, where, when, why, who, how, how many, how much.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To form a <span class=\"italic\">Wh- question</span> use:<br>  Wh- word + will (or won't) + subject + base form of the verb.<br><span class=\"italic\">Where will I look online?</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Quantifiers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something. <br><br> Remember there are general and specific quantifiers.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"General Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of<br>  Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the ...)<br> A couple of (the ...)<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some<br> Any<br> A little<br> Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of<br>None of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You won't find many listings there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There are no listings on the board. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There are some online. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you send me a few?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bulletin board "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a board on the wall where you put information or pictures "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can check out the bulletin board at school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apartment listing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small advertisement for an apartment  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  You won't find any apartment listings there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apartment hunting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of looking for an apartment "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Will you go apartment hunting with me?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vacancy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a room in a building that is available for someone to live in "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There's a vacancy at the apartment across the street. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "job opportunity "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a chance to get a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you know of any other job opportunities? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "work experience "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the experience you get from working at a job "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get some work experience. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. Find 3 different listings. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the listings and choose 1.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Rewrite the listing using the Simple Future tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Circle any quantifiers you use.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exchange listings with a  partner. Read their listing aloud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I choose a listing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Simple Future tense to rewrite a listing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use quantifiers in a listing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my partner's ad.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le03ob07re2img09.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob07re2img09.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: How's your job? Will you give the manager my r\u00e9sum\u00e9, please? I need a job! I want to gain some work experience. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure, they need a waitress. How did you find your apartment? I'm looking for one to rent.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: You can check on the bulletin boards at school."}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "16500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Bulletin board? Will there be anything there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: You won't find many apartment listings but there's a few there.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where else?"}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob07re2img08.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "24500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: Look in the newspaper or on the Internet. There are also a lot of listings online.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Those are good ideas. I'll look tonight. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: There are some good apartments just across the street from the school. They'll cost a little more and they can be noisy sometimes."}, {"image": "engenn5le03ob07re2img11.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "40500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll see if there are any vacancies. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>:  Do you know of any other job opportunities? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, but I'll keep an eye out. Will you go apartment hunting with me?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mika</span>: Of course!"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob07re2img09.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob07re2aud01"}}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": 